# Privacy Policy — Jarvis

Jarvis is a personal, single-user application built and operated by its
sole user. It connects to the WHOOP API to read the account holder's own
biometric data (recovery, sleep, and strain).

- **Who sees the data:** Only the account holder. There are no other users.
- **Sharing:** No data is shared with, sold to, or made accessible to any
  third party.
- **Storage:** Data is stored in a private database controlled solely by
  the account holder.
- **Deletion:** All stored data can be deleted at any time by the account
  holder, and WHOOP access can be revoked at any time from the WHOOP app.

Contact: the account holder is the operator of this application.
